uZL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"74215","synopsis":"Migi and Dali have been fully accepted as members of the Sonoyama family.\n\nThey behave just like real parent and child, but the twins notice that Mom and Dad are acting somewhat distant.\n\nSuspecting that the Sonoyama couple might be hiding something, the two discreetly begin to search the house and stumble upon an unexpected secret of the couple.\n\nMigi and Dali are shocked, wondering if they have been deceived. However, determined not to let things end this way, they execute a plan to retaliate against the Sonoyamas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4eMCrQ9rr3wPH5DTlXvCghNKrxS.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"74352","synopsis":"To uncover the truth behind their mother's death, Migi and Dali finally begin to take serious action.\n\nTheir clue is the memory of the room they lived in with their mother when they were young. They remember the dimly lit space under the bed and the wallpaper patterned wih daphnia.\n\nIn order to locate the room, the twins come up with a plan to be invited over as friends to different houses.\n\nThey promptly join the Boy Scouts to make friends, but the scouts offer their friendship on one condition.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/goLbi4007PQjDfUTPcUKlIc9fXI.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"74456","synopsis":"The housemaid Micchan tells Migi and Dali that the Ichijo family has a room with water flea wallpaper. They begin attending school to befriend Eiji, the son of the Ichijo family. However, to get close to Eiji, they need to score well on tests and join a top class. The two start studying diligently to boost their grades, but unexpectedly, Migi falls head over heels for a certain female student in the library.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mI27RyviRP2nE4FfrQmgbG35QVo.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"74561","synopsis":"After achieving first place in the test, the Sonoyama family was invited to the suspicious Ichijo residence. Dali, seeing this as an opportunity, thoroughly searches the Ichijo house. However, she falls into Eiji's trap, and Migi ends up being captured.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ptBr8EEn1SrlSRiH3tHjjAs8Q4w.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"74685","synopsis":"Dali continues to search the Ichijo house. Migi, by perfectly playing the role of an infant, tries to draw out the secrets of the Ichijo family.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qUBWegjlQZYSArBXRZOK5OBHaPf.jpg"},{"title":"Non era un fantasma","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"74904","synopsis":"\"It was Eiji who killed our mother!?\" To confirm the truth, Dali disguises herself as Sali and begins to approach Eiji alone.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/azhGKN8gquz3z7h4yPKQdplocLi.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"75107","synopsis":"Shocked to discover that Sali's true identity was Dali, Migi flees to Akiyama's house to escape. Dali comes to bring Migi back for revenge, but Migi decides to live freely, not bound by revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4pjjgg61viUHkRmcVW9tjc6fNpj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"75283","synopsis":"Why did Eiji help him? To find out, Migi disguises herself as Sally and visits Eiji's house. Eiji shows Sally (Migi) around the attic and tells her about Reiko's and Eiji's secret, and how it has put Hitori in danger. However, Reiko has also seen them talking! Migi recoils from Reiko's strange aura. At that moment, Migi witnesses Reiko's terrifying true nature.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tq2JjbQcq9Jc7ZkbgSNe2HexteK.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50586","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"153450","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"413466","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"75583","synopsis":"Framed as murderers by Reiko, Migi and Dali find themselves unable to reveal themselves and decide to seek help from Akiyama.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epD1JlMH0Eyv4ToWdk7jYHtWdVJ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17034","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"142666","